### GET All Users
GET http://localhost:5071/users
Authorization: valid-token

### GET User by ID
GET http://localhost:5071/users/1

### GET User by non-existent ID
GET http://localhost:5071/users/999

### POST User - Valid Data
POST http://localhost:5071/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Name": "Joe",
    "Email": "joe@email.com",
    "Age": 32
}

### POST User - Invalid Data (Missing Name)
POST http://localhost:5071/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Name": "",
    "Email": "joe@email.com",
    "Age": 32
}

### POST User - Invalid Data (Missing Email)
POST http://localhost:5071/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Name": "Joe",
    "Email": "",
    "Age": 32
}

### POST User - Invalid Data (Invalid Email 1)
POST http://localhost:5071/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Name": "Joe",
    "Email": "joeemail.com",
    "Age": 32
}

### POST User - Invalid Data (Invalid Email 2)
POST http://localhost:5071/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Name": "Joe",
    "Email": "joe@emailcom",
    "Age": 32
}

### POST User - Invalid Data (Negative Age)
POST http://localhost:5071/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Name": "Joe",
    "Email": "joe@email.com",
    "Age": -5
}

### PUT User - Valid Data
PUT http://localhost:5071/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Name": "Larry",
    "Email": "larry@email.com",
    "Age": 55
}

### PUT User - Invalid Data (Missing Name)
PUT http://localhost:5071/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Name": "",
    "Email": "larry@email.com",
    "Age": 55
}

### PUT User - Invalid Data (Missing Email)
PUT http://localhost:5071/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Name": "Larry",
    "Email": "",
    "Age": 55
}

### PUT User - Invalid Data (Invalid Email 1)
PUT http://localhost:5071/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Name": "Larry",
    "Email": "larryemail.com",
    "Age": 55
}

### PUT User - Invalid Data (Invalid Email 2)
