{
    "Name": "Larry",
    "Email": "larry@email.com",
    "Age": 55
}

### DELETE User
DELETE http://localhost:5071/users/1

### DELETE User - Non-existent ID
DELETE http://localhost:5071/users/999

### Throws an error
GET http://localhost:5071/error